/outputs/casbot02_sim2sim/*
!/outputs/casbot02_sim2sim/*.json
!/outputs/casbot02_sim2sim/README.md
!/outputs/casbot02_sim2sim/preview.png

# Small audit reports only; motion data, binaries and backups remain local.
!/outputs/casbot02_retarget_limits_20261029/
